I think the Ultima gremlins that stole food were original there.  The
word gremlin is aeronautical slang for the mysterious force that 
makes complicated machinery fail for absolutely no reason.  It may
go back further, but the accounts I've seen point back to WWII RAF
and USAAF flight crews.  Exactly what they looked like and what 
they did never seemed to be determined, but SOMETHING malevolent 
must be responsible when things don't work right.  Animism in 
action.  I think NetHack gremlins are purely from the movie.

